1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:12,723
=Episode 12=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(Caught in the Act)

4
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,524
Father!

5
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,360
How dare you!

6
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,920
You covet my favored consort?

7
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,040
Father, please judge wisely.

8
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,360
I'm innocent!

9
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,240
This maid...

10
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:49,720
She suddenly stumbled.

11
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:50,960
I only helped her up.

12
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:51,640
I never expected

13
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,200
she'd cling to me.

14
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:53,640
Father.

15
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,520
I didn't mean to! Father!

16
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,320
Spare me, Your Majesty!

17
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:58,240
I am guilty!

18
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:01,760
You insolent wretch!

19
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,360
You dare shame the palace?

20
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,320
I wouldn't dare!

21
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,360
I can explain!

22
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,280
Explain what?

23
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,360
All under heaven

24
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,320
is His Majesty's land.

25
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,440
All on this soil

26
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,240
are His Majesty's subjects.

27
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,800
Every woman in the harem

28
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,120
belongs to His Majesty.

29
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,760
Whatever your excuse,

30
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,560
how dare you covet His Majesty's woman?

31
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,680
I deserve to die!

32
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,680
Spare the prince, Your Majesty.

33
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:23,360
I was the one who deliberately
flirted with him,

34
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,960
hoping to win his favor

35
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,280
and rise to the top in one step..

36
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,440
Spare me, Your Majesty.

37
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,120
Guards.

38
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:30,560
Drag this wretch out
and feed her to the dogs!

39
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,360
Your Majesty!

40
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,520
Please hear me out.

41
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,640
This concerns something grave.

42
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:35,800
Once I have spoken my mind,

43
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,160
I will gladly face death.

44
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,320
Speak.

45
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:42,320
I served as Zhaoyi Shen's personal maid.

46
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,120
After she was punished,

47
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,120
Princess Jinxuan

48
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,560
was sent to live in Chengxi Palace,
under Noble Consort Hui.

49
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:48,800
I heard that

50
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:51,800
the princess has suffered greatly there.

51
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,080
Noble Consort Hui often mistreats her.

52
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,720
The princess misses her mother

53
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,760
and cries every night.

54
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,280
Noble Consort Hui beats and scolds her,

55
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,080
and denies her food and water.

56
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:04,360
She even has people
give her a knockout draught

57
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,200
to keep her unconscious.

58
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,880
Zhaoyi Shen was always kind to me.

59
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,240
My heart ached for the princess.

60
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,800
But I'm a nobody,

61
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,320
so I took this desperate step,

62
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,400
hoping to win the eldest prince's favor.

63
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,480
Then perhaps

64
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,920
I could help Princess Jinxuan.

65
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,800
Even if I could only serve her,

66
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,680
that would be my greatest wish.

67
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:29,480
Are you certain

68
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,920
every word is true?

69
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,960
If even one word of mine is false,

70
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,600
may I be torn limb from limb!

71
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,000
Father.

72
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,360
She did this

73
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:40,080
for the sake of Princess Jinxuan.

74
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,280
She had no other choice.

75
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:43,480
I beg you to show her mercy.

76
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,320
For your loyalty and devotion,

77
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,800
I shall pardon you.

78
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,800
Thank you for sparing me!

79
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,880
Long live Your Majesty!

80
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,640
Stop.

81
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:00,680
Running so fast...

82
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,920
Are you rushing to warn your mistress?

83
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:03,760
Your Highness.

84
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,120
I've been away too long.

85
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,440
I must hurry back to my duties.

86
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,880
Noble Consort Hui is waiting.

87
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,680
I'll take my leave.

88
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,520
Hold her.

89
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,200
What is this about?

90
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:14,440
Tonight's show isn't over yet.

91
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,480
You can't go back and warn her.

92
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:18,600
I am Noble Consort Hui's senior maid.

93
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,680
How dare you detain me?

94
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,240
Aren't you afraid she'll punish you?

95
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,840
Your mistress

96
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,120
is busy meeting her lover right now.

97
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,560
She won't have time to punish me.

98
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:27,560
Take her away.

99
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,520
Let go!

100
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,560
You bold scoundrel.

101
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,480
How dare you

102
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,800
come here so openly?

103
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,080
My brother is

104
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:49,480
in the Imperial Garden,

105
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,640
dealing with the prince

106
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,440
and Concubine Rou's affair.

107
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:57,040
Such a good chance,

108
00:03:57,600 --> 00:04:00,360
how could I not come see you?

109
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,320
You rascal.

110
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,280
Even heroes fall for a beauty.

111
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,360
Our beauty trap

112
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,400
struck right at His Majesty's heart.

113
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:12,520
Now it's done.

114
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,880
The eldest prince will be deposed,

115
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:17,000
and our son can finally take the throne.

116
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:20,480
I've plotted for so long.

117
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,280
At last, it has paid off.

118
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,120
My brother took everything.

119
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:27,160
The throne belongs to him,

120
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,120
and so do you.

121
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,400
At last, I've won a round.

122
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,160
When our son takes the throne,

123
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,280
that will be my greatest revenge.

124
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,320
My lord.

125
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:51,120
We can never be together openly,

126
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:55,040
but we must see our son
rise to the throne.

127
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,360
Huilan.

128
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,160
All these years,

129
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,120
you've suffered so much.

130
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,840
It was nothing.

131
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,920
As long as you hold me in your heart,

132
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,720
that's enough for me.

133
00:05:25,739 --> 00:05:30,066
(Chengxi Palace)

134
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,040
Princess Jinxuan.

135
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,520
Yaoqin, you're here.

136
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,880
Weren't you sent to the Sin Jeku?

137
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,880
I heard you suffer terribly,

138
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,280
and I worried for you.

139
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,760
Yaoqin.

140
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,040
Noble Consort Hui beats me.

141
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,840
She even gives me knockout draughts.

142
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,360
Don't cry, Princess.

143
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,840
I'm here to help you.

144
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:13,360
Tonight, wait for His Majesty
in the palace corridor.

145
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,920
Then say exactly what I taught you.

146
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:28,720
Jinxuan.

147
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,360
Jinxuan.

148
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:32,680
It's so late.

149
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,080
Why are you sitting here?

150
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,440
Father.

151
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,520
I've finally waited for you.

152
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:38,880
I've missed you so much.

153
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:42,400
If you miss me, ask Noble Consort Hui

154
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,360
to bring you to my study.

155
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:46,920
But Noble Consort Hui said,

156
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,560
I'm the daughter of a disgraced consort.

157
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,840
I have no right to see you, Father.

158
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,000
How could that be?

159
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,040
Whenever you wish to see me,

160
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,000
you may come.

161
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,760
Where is Noble Consort Hui?

162
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,560
Uncle Prince Su...

163
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,960
He came to Chengxi Palace.

164
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,320
He's inside with Noble Consort Hui.

165
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,560
Your Majesty!

166
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,600
Your Majesty!

167
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,840
Brother!

168
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,080
How dare you two!

169
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,200
Your Majesty!

170
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,040
I...

171
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,600
I can explain.

172
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,120
Your Majesty.

173
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,880
I saw it with my own eyes.

174
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,680
You and Prince Su, here in my harem,

175
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,600
engaging in such vile acts.

176
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,720
How do you explain that?

177
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,440
Your Majesty...

178
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,600
Please forgive me!

179
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,160
I was foolish...

180
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,800
I lost my senses.

181
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,000
Brother.

182
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,160
This is all my fault.

183
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:39,000
I coveted her beauty

184
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,600
and forced myself upon her.

185
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:41,520
I...

186
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:42,800
I deserve death.

187
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,000
Brother...

188
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,040
I never knew you were so devoted.

189
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,240
You deceived me all day long,

190
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,440
then at night,

191
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,760
in my own harem,

192
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,160
you sneak around like a thief.

193
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,480
Fine.

194
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,920
Since you love each other so dearly,

195
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,400
I'll grant your wish.

196
00:08:59,160 --> 00:08:59,960
Guards.

197
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,000
Take them away!

198
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,440
Your Majesty.

199
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,600
Your Majesty!

200
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,560
The Empress Dowager arrives!

201
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:12,280
Your Highness.

202
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,480
Mother.

203
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,080
Why have you returned early?

204
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,840
Had I not returned now,

205
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,320
I would have missed

206
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,320
this family feud.

207
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,440
I just entered the palace

208
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,680
and heard of this disgrace.

209
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:30,480
You never give me a moment's peace!

210
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,520
This vast imperial harem...

211
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,600
When will it ever know peace?

212
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,320
Your Highness!

213
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,040
Please save Huilan.

214
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,600
I've repented, Your Highness.

215
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,120
I truly have!

216
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,040
Silence!

217
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,880
You've brought such shame

218
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,360
upon this old face of mine!

219
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:47,560
Tell me,

220
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:50,240
what happened between the eldest prince
and Concubine Rou?

221
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,680
One night away,

222
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:54,760
and the harem's upside down.

223
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:56,640
So much has happened.

224
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:58,160
Are you all trying

225
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,880
to drive me to my grave?

226
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,120
Mother, please calm down.

227
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,680
I apologize for disturbing you.

228
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,520
The eldest prince and Concubine Rou...

229
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:05,160
It's a misunderstanding.

230
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,080
It's been settled.

231
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:08,800
Concubine Rou is fine?

232
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:10,280
She's still alive?

233
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,920
Why were they let off?

234
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,640
Noble Consort Hui.

235
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,360
Did you wish for Concubine Rou

236
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,040
and the prince to be punished?

237
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,680
You deliberately told me

238
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,480
that they were engrossed in Go,

239
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,040
sharpening each other through play,

240
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,320
like jade being polished.

241
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:29,000
Now that I think of it,

242
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,600
What was your intent?

243
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,480
Now, confess!

244
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,280
Otherwise,

245
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:38,080
even I may not be able to save you.

246
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,200
Your Majesty.

247
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,280
Your Majesty.

248
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,200
I'll confess.

249
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:44,080
I saw the prince and Concubine Rou

250
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,720
playing Go,

251
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,400
and behaving improperly.

252
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,480
So I made an issue of it.

253
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,000
I was foolish.

254
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,000
I know I was wrong.

255
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,080
I shouldn't have envied her

256
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,360
or spread false rumors.

257
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:51,880
Your Majesty.

258
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,320
I know I was wrong!

259
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:54,520
Noble Consort Hui

260
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,640
has a silver tongue.

261
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,760
Such a grave matter,

262
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,400
and with a few words,

263
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,640
you turn it into

264
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,200
nothing more than

265
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,800
jealousy among consorts.

266
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,400
If you ask me,

267
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,720
she's evading the real issue.

268
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:09,880
Your jealousy is false.

269
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:11,080
What you truly wanted

270
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,360
was to destroy the eldest prince.

271
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,160
Nonsense!

272
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,920
You're just taking this chance
to kick me down!

273
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,200
Who do you think you are?

274
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,600
Who gave you the right to speak?

275
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:20,560
Your Majesty.

276
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:21,760
Physician Li of Imperial Hospital

277
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:22,680
urgently seeks an audience.

278
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,360
He says the second prince is injured

279
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,240
and it's urgent.

280
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,360
The second prince's injured?

281
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:27,240
Let him in.

282
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:28,000
Yes.

283
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:35,880
Your Majesty.

284
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:36,840
Your Highness.

285
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,760
The second prince caught a cold,

286
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,320
and cut his hand while taking medicine.

287
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,320
The bleeding won't stop.

288
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,160
Won't stop?

289
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,200
How could a cut on the hand
keep bleeding like this?

290
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,360
Your Majesty.

291
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,600
The bleeding won't stop because...

292
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,000
He suffers from a blood disorder.

293
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,120
I dare not conceal this.

294
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:54,760
What?

295
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,760
Because of a blood disorder,

296
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:57,800
he cannot stop bleeding.

297
00:11:58,160 --> 00:11:59,480
Blood disorder?

298
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,760
I've never heard

299
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:05,280
he had such an ailment.

300
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,440
Ordinary people

301
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,800
heal once bandaged.

302
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,960
But with this disorder,

303
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:09,760
it's hard to heal.

304
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,520
I reviewed his medical records

305
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,920
from past years,

306
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,880
but found no record of this condition.

307
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,360
His pulse records

308
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:17,560
do not match his condition.

309
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,320
I dare not treat him, so I came

310
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,800
to seek Your Majesty's orders.

311
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:24,720
Brother.

312
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:27,200
If I recall correctly,

313
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:30,000
you had this as a child too.

314
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,400
What else is Chengxi Palace

315
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:38,360
hiding from me?

316
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:39,960
Noble Consort Hui.

317
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,240
What do you have to say now?

318
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,480
Your Majesty.

319
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,400
I never meant to hide it.

320
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,880
I only feared it would worry you.

321
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,240
It's not a blood disorder!

322
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:50,920
That's right!

323
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,360
It's not a blood disorder!

324
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,440
They're trying to frame me.

325
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,280
They're trying to frame my prince!

326
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,000
Imperial Hospital follows
the medical texts.

327
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,040
Why would they make this up?

328
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,280
Concerning the imperial heir,

329
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:02,240
who'd dare frame it?

330
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:05,360
What an outrage!

331
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,720
Royal blood is of utmost importance.

332
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,520
We cannot afford to take chances.

333
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,040
Eunuch Liu.

334
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,040
Yes.

335
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,320
Have the physicians
bring a bowl of clear water.

336
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,000
I shall test their blood to
determine kinship.

337
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,400
Yes.

338
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:36,160
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

339
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:41,200
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

340
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:46,000
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

341
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:50,840
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

342
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:55,600
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

343
00:13:56,040 --> 00:14:00,640
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

344
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:05,440
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

345
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:10,400
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

346
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:15,160
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

347
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:18,720
♪Let the stars and sea♪

348
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:20,040
(Changsheng Gate)

349
00:14:20,064 --> 00:14:23,944
♪Wait for your return♪
